@@ -533,3 +533,5 @@ and out-of-scope item IDs return invalid params (`-32602`) with
 Omitted or null cursors preserve normal first-page behavior. Continue anchored
 pages with the returned opaque string `nextCursor`; response fields and
 `backwardsCursor` semantics are unchanged.
+
+In Tweakers shared-native mode, `plugin/installed` accepts `nativeBaseInventoryOnly: true` to read the authenticated account's raw installed inventory. This read excludes local/shared overrides and does not install or update packages. The broker binds the native account before publishing shared membership. Omitting the flag retains the ordinary installed-plugin view.
